{"seq":2,"slug":"memory-map-boot-process","title":"存储器映射与启动流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/microcontroller-fundamentals/memory-map-boot-process","wordCount":1923,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"存储器映射与启动流程\">存储器映射与启动流程</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Cortex-M 把 4 GB 地址空间划分成固定用途的区域，无论芯片厂商如何集成 Flash 与外设，软件都能依赖这套统一编址模型。围绕它展开的核心概念有四条：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>统一地址空间</strong>：Code/SRAM/Peripheral/PPB 等区域各有固定地址范围与访问属性，跨厂商可移植</li>\n<li><strong>向量表</strong>：存储器起始位置的地址表，保存初始栈指针与全部异常入口，可通过 VTOR 重定位</li>\n<li><strong>启动流程</strong>：硬件复位按固定顺序读取 SP 与 PC，再由 startup 代码完成 C 运行时初始化</li>\n<li><strong>链接与分段</strong>：链接脚本定义段与区域的布局，VMA/LMA 之分决定哪些数据需要在启动时搬运</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"统一地址空间\">统一地址空间</h2><p>ARM Cortex-M 采用 32 位统一编址的存储器映射模型，将 4 GB 地址空间划分为固定用途的区域。无论芯片厂商如何集成 Flash 和外设，其物理地址必须落在 ARM 定义的区域范围内，确保软件的可移植性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;0x00000000 - 0x1FFFFFFF&lt;br/&gt;代码区 (512 MB)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;0x20000000 - 0x3FFFFFFF&lt;br/&gt;SRAM 区 (512 MB)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;0x40000000 - 0x5FFFFFFF&lt;br/&gt;外设区 (512 MB)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;0x60000000 - 0x9FFFFFFF&lt;br/&gt;外部 RAM (1 GB)&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;0xA0000000 - 0xDFFFFFFF&lt;br/&gt;外部设备 (1 GB)&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;0xE0000000 - 0xE00FFFFF&lt;br/&gt;系统外设 (1 MB)&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;0xE0100000 - 0xFFFFFFFF&lt;br/&gt;厂商自定义&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"0x00000000 - 0x1FFFFFFF&lt;br/&gt;代码区 (512 MB)\"] --&gt; B[\"0x20000000 - 0x3FFFFFFF&lt;br/&gt;SRAM 区 (512 MB)\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"0x40000000 - 0x5FFFFFFF&lt;br/&gt;外设区 (512 MB)\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"0x60000000 - 0x9FFFFFFF&lt;br/&gt;外部 RAM (1 GB)\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"0xA0000000 - 0xDFFFFFFF&lt;br/&gt;外部设备 (1 GB)\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"0xE0000000 - 0xE00FFFFF&lt;br/&gt;系统外设 (1 MB)\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"0xE0100000 - 0xFFFFFFFF&lt;br/&gt;厂商自定义\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>地址范围</th>\n<th>区域名称</th>\n<th>大小</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>访问属性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0x00000000 - 0x1FFFFFFF</td>\n<td>Code</td>\n<td>512 MB</td>\n<td>Flash、Boot ROM</td>\n<td>可执行、可缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0x20000000 - 0x3FFFFFFF</td>\n<td>SRAM</td>\n<td>512 MB</td>\n<td>内部 RAM、位带区</td>\n<td>可执行、可缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0x40000000 - 0x5FFFFFFF</td>\n<td>Peripheral</td>\n<td>512 MB</td>\n<td>片上外设寄存器</td>\n<td>设备序、非缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0x60000000 - 0x9FFFFFFF</td>\n<td>External RAM</td>\n<td>1 GB</td>\n<td>外部 SDRAM/PSRAM</td>\n<td>可缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0xA0000000 - 0xDFFFFFFF</td>\n<td>External Device</td>\n<td>1 GB</td>\n<td>外部 FPGA/NOR Flash</td>\n<td>设备属性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0xE0000000 - 0xE00FFFFF</td>\n<td>PPB</td>\n<td>1 MB</td>\n<td>NVIC、SysTick、SCB、MPU</td>\n<td>强序访问</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>系统外设区（PPB，Private Peripheral Bus）是 ARM 内核自带外设的固定映射区域：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>0xE000E010</code>：SysTick 控制与状态寄存器</li>\n<li><code>0xE000E100</code>：NVIC 中断使能寄存器组</li>\n<li><code>0xE000ED00</code>：SCB（System Control Block）起始地址</li>\n<li><code>0xE000EDF0</code>：调试控制寄存器（CoreSight）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"向量表\">向量表</h2><h3 id=\"结构定义\">结构定义</h3><p>向量表位于存储器的起始位置（默认 <code>0x00000000</code>），包含初始栈指针值和所有异常处理函数的入口地址：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>偏移</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0x00</td>\n<td>初始 MSP 值</td>\n<td>上电后 SP 的初始值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0x04</td>\n<td>Reset_Handler 地址</td>\n<td>复位后第一条执行指令</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0x08</td>\n<td>NMI_Handler 地址</td>\n<td>不可屏蔽中断入口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0x0C</td>\n<td>HardFault_Handler 地址</td>\n<td>硬件故障入口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0x10</td>\n<td>MemManage_Handler</td>\n<td>存储器管理故障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0x14</td>\n<td>BusFault_Handler</td>\n<td>总线故障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0x18</td>\n<td>UsageFault_Handler</td>\n<td>用法故障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0x2C</td>\n<td>SVCall_Handler</td>\n<td>系统调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0x38</td>\n<td>PendSV_Handler</td>\n<td>可挂起系统调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0x3C</td>\n<td>SysTick_Handler</td>\n<td>系统滴答中断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0x40+</td>\n<td>IRQ0 - IRQn</td>\n<td>外设中断入口</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>向量表中存储的是函数地址（最低位置 1 表示 Thumb 模式），而非指令本身。硬件在响应异常时直接从表中读取地址加载到 PC。</p>\n<h3 id=\"向量表重定位\">向量表重定位</h3><p>通过 SCB 的 VTOR（Vector Table Offset Register）寄存器可以将向量表重定位到 SRAM 或其他 Flash 区域：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>VTOR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>新向量表基址（必须对齐到表大小的</mtext><mn>2</mn><mtext>的幂次边界）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{VTOR} = \\text{新向量表基址}（必须对齐到表大小的 2 的幂次边界）</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">VTOR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">新向量表基址</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（必须对齐到表大小的</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的幂次边界）</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>重定位场景包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Bootloader 跳转到应用程序时切换向量表</li>\n<li>运行时动态修改中断处理函数（向量表放 SRAM）</li>\n<li>多固件分区场景下各分区独立的向量表</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"启动流程详解\">启动流程详解</h2><h3 id=\"硬件复位序列\">硬件复位序列</h3><p>Cortex-M 的硬件复位遵循严格的确定性流程：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>上电</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>复位释放</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>读取 [0x00] 作为 SP</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>读取 [0x04] 作为 PC</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>开始执行</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{上电} \\rightarrow \\text{复位释放} \\rightarrow \\text{读取 [0x00] 作为 SP} \\rightarrow \\text{读取 [0x04] 作为 PC} \\rightarrow \\text{开始执行}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">上电</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">复位释放</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">读取</span><span class=\"mord\"> [0x00] </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">作为</span><span class=\"mord\"> SP</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">读取</span><span class=\"mord\"> [0x04] </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">作为</span><span class=\"mord\"> PC</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">开始执行</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant HW as 硬件&#10;    participant CPU as Cortex-M 内核&#10;    participant Flash as Flash 存储器&#10;&#10;    HW-&gt;&gt;CPU: 释放 RESET 信号&#10;    CPU-&gt;&gt;Flash: 读取地址 0x00000000&#10;    Flash--&gt;&gt;CPU: 返回初始 SP 值&#10;    CPU-&gt;&gt;CPU: 加载到 MSP&#10;    CPU-&gt;&gt;Flash: 读取地址 0x00000004&#10;    Flash--&gt;&gt;CPU: 返回 Reset_Handler 地址&#10;    CPU-&gt;&gt;CPU: 加载到 PC,开始执行&#10;    CPU-&gt;&gt;CPU: Reset_Handler 执行\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant HW as 硬件\n    participant CPU as Cortex-M 内核\n    participant Flash as Flash 存储器\n\n    HW-&gt;&gt;CPU: 释放 RESET 信号\n    CPU-&gt;&gt;Flash: 读取地址 0x00000000\n    Flash--&gt;&gt;CPU: 返回初始 SP 值\n    CPU-&gt;&gt;CPU: 加载到 MSP\n    CPU-&gt;&gt;Flash: 读取地址 0x00000004\n    Flash--&gt;&gt;CPU: 返回 Reset_Handler 地址\n    CPU-&gt;&gt;CPU: 加载到 PC,开始执行\n    CPU-&gt;&gt;CPU: Reset_Handler 执行</pre><h3 id=\"boot-引脚配置\">Boot 引脚配置</h3><p>STM32 系列通过 BOOT0/BOOT1 引脚（或选项字节）决定启动地址映射：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>BOOT1</th>\n<th>BOOT0</th>\n<th>启动区域</th>\n<th>映射到 0x00000000</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>X</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>主 Flash</td>\n<td>0x08000000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>系统存储器</td>\n<td>0x1FFF0000（内置 Bootloader）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>嵌入式 SRAM</td>\n<td>0x20000000</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>系统存储器中固化了 ST 出厂写入的 Bootloader 程序，支持通过 UART、USB、I2C、SPI 等接口进行固件下载，无需额外调试器。</p>\n<h3 id=\"c-运行时初始化\">C 运行时初始化</h3><p>从 Reset_Handler 到 main() 之间的启动代码（通常称为 startup 文件或 crt0）完成以下初始化：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>初始化 .data 段</strong>：将已初始化全局变量从 Flash（LMA）复制到 SRAM（VMA）</li>\n<li><strong>清零 .bss 段</strong>：将未初始化全局变量区域填充为 0</li>\n<li><strong>初始化堆栈</strong>：设置堆（heap）和栈（stack）的边界</li>\n<li><strong>调用 SystemInit()</strong>：配置时钟系统（可选，CMSIS 标准接口）</li>\n<li><strong>调用 __libc_init_array()</strong>：执行 C++ 全局构造函数（若使用 C++）</li>\n<li><strong>跳转 main()</strong>：进入用户应用代码</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"链接脚本\">链接脚本</h2><h3 id=\"段与区域定义\">段与区域定义</h3><p>链接脚本（.ld 文件）定义了代码和数据在存储器中的布局：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"MEMORY {&#10;    FLASH (rx)  : ORIGIN = 0x08000000, LENGTH = 512K&#10;    SRAM  (rwx) : ORIGIN = 0x20000000, LENGTH = 128K&#10;}&#10;&#10;SECTIONS {&#10;    .isr_vector : { *(.isr_vector) } &gt; FLASH&#10;    .text       : { *(.text*) } &gt; FLASH&#10;    .rodata     : { *(.rodata*) } &gt; FLASH&#10;    .data       : { *(.data*) } &gt; SRAM AT&gt; FLASH&#10;    .bss        : { *(.bss*) } &gt; SRAM&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>MEMORY {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    FLASH (rx)  : ORIGIN = 0x08000000, LENGTH = 512K</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    SRAM  (rwx) : ORIGIN = 0x20000000, LENGTH = 128K</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>SECTIONS {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .isr_vector : { *(.isr_vector) } > FLASH</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .text       : { *(.text*) } > FLASH</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .rodata     : { *(.rodata*) } > FLASH</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .data       : { *(.data*) } > SRAM AT> FLASH</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .bss        : { *(.bss*) } > SRAM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>VMA（Virtual Memory Address）</strong>：运行时地址，程序访问时使用</li>\n<li><strong>LMA（Load Memory Address）</strong>：加载地址，固件烧写时的物理位置</li>\n<li><code>.data</code> 段的 VMA 在 SRAM 但 LMA 在 Flash，启动代码负责将内容从 LMA 复制到 VMA</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"栈与堆布局\">栈与堆布局</h3><p>典型的嵌入式栈堆布局采用&quot;栈顶堆底&quot;模型：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>SRAM 布局</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>.data</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>.bss</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>heap</mtext><mo>↑</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mtext>空闲</mtext><mo>⋯</mo><mo>↓</mo><mtext>stack</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SRAM 布局} = [\\text{.data}][\\text{.bss}][\\text{heap} \\uparrow \\cdots \\text{空闲} \\cdots \\downarrow \\text{stack}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SRAM </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">布局</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">.data</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">.bss</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">heap</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">空闲</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↓</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">stack</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>栈向低地址增长，堆向高地址增长。两者相向生长意味着溢出时会互相覆盖，嵌入式系统中需要通过 MPU 或 canary 值检测栈溢出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"flash-等待状态\">Flash 等待状态</h2><h3 id=\"等待状态与性能\">等待状态与性能</h3><p>片内 Flash 的访问速度通常低于 CPU 主频，需要插入等待状态（Wait States）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>等待状态数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>HCLK</mtext></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>Flash_max</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{等待状态数} = \\lceil \\frac{f_{\\text{HCLK}}}{f_{\\text{Flash\\_max}}} \\rceil - 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">等待状态数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4244em;vertical-align:-1.053em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Flash_max</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">HCLK</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.053em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>以 STM32F4 为例（Flash 最大无等待频率约 30 MHz）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>HCLK 频率</th>\n<th>等待状态</th>\n<th>有效带宽损失</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>≤ 30 MHz</td>\n<td>0 WS</td>\n<td>0%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>≤ 60 MHz</td>\n<td>1 WS</td>\n<td>~50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>≤ 90 MHz</td>\n<td>2 WS</td>\n<td>~67%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>≤ 120 MHz</td>\n<td>3 WS</td>\n<td>~75%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>≤ 150 MHz</td>\n<td>4 WS</td>\n<td>~80%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>≤ 168 MHz</td>\n<td>5 WS</td>\n<td>~83%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"加速缓存机制\">加速缓存机制</h3><p>为缓解等待状态的性能损失，STM32 引入 ART Accelerator（自适应实时加速器）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>预取缓冲</strong>：利用 128 位 Flash 数据宽度一次读取多条指令</li>\n<li><strong>指令缓存</strong>：64 行 × 128 位 = 1 KB 指令缓存</li>\n<li><strong>数据缓存</strong>：8 行 × 128 位 = 128 字节数据缓存</li>\n</ul>\n<p>启用 ART 加速器后，对于线性执行的代码，等效访问延迟接近 0 等待状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"存储器保护单元\">存储器保护单元</h2><p>MPU（Memory Protection Unit）允许将地址空间划分为若干区域并为每个区域设置访问权限和属性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>访问权限</td>\n<td>No Access / RO / RW</td>\n<td>区分特权级和非特权级访问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可执行</td>\n<td>XN（Execute Never）</td>\n<td>防止数据区域被执行（抵御代码注入）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存策略</td>\n<td>Write-Back / Write-Through / Non-Cacheable</td>\n<td>控制数据一致性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共享属性</td>\n<td>Shareable / Non-shareable</td>\n<td>多主设备一致性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>MPU 在 RTOS 环境中实现任务间的内存隔离：每个任务切换时重新配置 MPU 区域，使任务只能访问自己的栈和全局数据段，越界访问触发 MemManage 异常。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>区域大小约束</mtext><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mtext> 字节（</mtext><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext>，即最小</mtext><mn>32</mn><mtext>字节）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{区域大小约束} = 2^n \\text{ 字节}（n \\geq 5，即最小 32 字节）</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">区域大小约束</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8504em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，即最小</span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节）</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>区域起始地址必须对齐到区域大小，子区域禁用（SRD）机制允许在大区域中禁用 1/8 的粒度块，提供更灵活的保护粒度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>统一编址</strong>：4 GB 空间按用途固定划分（Code/SRAM/Peripheral/外部 RAM/PPB），保证跨厂商可移植；PPB 是内核自带外设的固定映射区。</li>\n<li><strong>向量表</strong>：起始处保存初始 MSP 与全部异常入口地址（最低位置 1 表示 Thumb），可通过 VTOR 重定位用于 Bootloader 切换、SRAM 向量表等场景。</li>\n<li><strong>启动流程</strong>：复位后硬件依次读取 [0x00] 作 SP、[0x04] 作 PC；随后 startup 代码初始化 .data/.bss、堆栈并跳转 main()。</li>\n<li><strong>链接与分段</strong>：.data 段 VMA 在 SRAM、LMA 在 Flash，启动时需搬运；栈顶堆底相向生长，靠 MPU 或 canary 检测溢出。</li>\n<li><strong>Flash 与保护</strong>：等待状态随主频上升而增加，ART 加速器缓解取指损失；MPU 用 2 的幂次对齐区域实现任务隔离。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"存储器映射与启动流程","id":"存储器映射与启动流程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"统一地址空间","id":"统一地址空间"},{"level":2,"text":"向量表","id":"向量表"},{"level":3,"text":"结构定义","id":"结构定义"},{"level":3,"text":"向量表重定位","id":"向量表重定位"},{"level":2,"text":"启动流程详解","id":"启动流程详解"},{"level":3,"text":"硬件复位序列","id":"硬件复位序列"},{"level":3,"text":"Boot 引脚配置","id":"boot-引脚配置"},{"level":3,"text":"C 运行时初始化","id":"c-运行时初始化"},{"level":2,"text":"链接脚本","id":"链接脚本"},{"level":3,"text":"段与区域定义","id":"段与区域定义"},{"level":3,"text":"栈与堆布局","id":"栈与堆布局"},{"level":2,"text":"Flash 等待状态","id":"flash-等待状态"},{"level":3,"text":"等待状态与性能","id":"等待状态与性能"},{"level":3,"text":"加速缓存机制","id":"加速缓存机制"},{"level":2,"text":"存储器保护单元","id":"存储器保护单元"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"MCU 架构与 ARM Cortex-M 内核","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/microcontroller-fundamentals/mcu-architecture-cortex-m"},"next":{"title":"时钟系统与电源管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/microcontroller-fundamentals/clock-system-power-management"}}